{
  "title": "书签",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>书签</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">书签代表您正在关注的社交内容。所选书签的讨论内容将显示在讨论面板中。</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/bookmarks.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <h2>默认书签</h2>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\">默认书签是自动设置的，对所有用户可用：</p>\n      <ul style=\"list-style: disc; font-weight: normal;\">\n        <li style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">所有书签：</b><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>这是默认书签，当您打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">我的讨论</span>时处于活动状态。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">它会同时显示来自所有书签的汇总内容。</span></p>\n        </li>\n        <li style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">我的消息：</b><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>您创建的所有消息（不包括由用户间接创建的历史消息）</p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">这些书签始终以固定顺序显示在顶部，且不能被折叠。</span></p>\n      <h2>书签组</h2>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">用</span>户可以创建/添加的书签被分为 4 个书签组：</p>\n      <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">人员</span>：</b><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>代表指定人员创建的所有消息的书签（不包括由用户间接创建的历史消息）</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">论坛：</b><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>代表论坛的书签</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">条目：</b></span>            <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>            <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">代表单个条目的书签</span></p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">每</span>个组在书签中都有一个标题，可以展开或折叠该组。</p>\n      <h2>书签搜索</h2>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">搜索书签</span>字段位于书签面板的顶部。在此字段中输入搜索条件，然后单击图标。搜索是通过在书签名称中搜索输入的搜索字符串来完成的。</p>\n      <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/searchbook.jpg\"></p>\n      <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        \n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <p class=\"Content_body\">当搜索结果生效时，讨论面板中仅显示符合搜索条件的书签。</p>\n          <h2>书签的右键菜单功能</h2>\n          <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">书签将提供以下右键菜单命令：</span></p>\n          <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\" width=\"786\">\n            <colgroup>\n              <col style=\"width: 29.644%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 28.376%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 41.98%;\">\n            </colgroup>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 47px;\">\n                <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">书签类型</p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">右键菜单选项</p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">说明</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">默认组内</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">设为默认</p>\n                </td>\n                <td rowspan=\"6\" style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  \n                  \n                  \n                  <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n                    <li>\n                      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; font-weight: bold;\">设</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">为默认</span><br style=\"page-break-before: always;\"> 设置用户今后打开\"我的讨论\"时使用的默认书签（默认设置为\"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">所有消息</span>\"）</p>\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                  \n                  <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n                    <li>\n                      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">共享...</span><br style=\"page-break-before: always;\"> 更改论坛的共享设置。打开\"共享论坛\"对话框。</p>\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                  \n                  <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n                    <li>\n                      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">打开</span><br style=\"page-break-before: always;\"> 在弹出窗口中打开条目的表单</p>\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                  \n                  <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n                    <li>\n                      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">移除</span><br style=\"page-break-before: always;\"> 如果选择了书签，则将其从书签中移除<br style=\"page-break-before: always;\"> 如果选择了论坛中的条目或保存的搜索，则将其从论坛中移除</p>\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 71px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">消息来自</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">移除</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">设为默认</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 99px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\"><span class=\"Bold\">论坛</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">共享...</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">移除</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">设为默认</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 71px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">论坛内的条目</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">移除</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">设为默认</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 59px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">论坛内的保存的搜索</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">移除</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 99px;\">\n                <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">条目（在条目组中）</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">移除</p>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">设为默认</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Bookmarks.htm"
}